<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Your bill for <%= monthName %> <%= year %></title>
  <style>
    body { margin: 0; padding: 0; background: #f4f8fb; color: #263746; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; }
    .wrapper { width: 100%; padding: 32px 0; }
    .card { width: 92%; max-width: 620px; margin: 0 auto; background: #fff; border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 4px 18px rgba(25, 65, 90, .08); }
    .header { padding: 28px 36px; background: #087f8c; color: #fff; }
    .brand { margin: 0; font-size: 24px; font-weight: bold; }
    .content { padding: 36px; line-height: 1.6; }
    h1 { margin: 0 0 8px; color: #123c4a; font-size: 26px; }
    .lead { margin: 0 0 24px; color: #55707d; }
    .rate { padding: 14px 18px; margin: 0 0 24px; border-radius: 8px; background: #eef7f8; color: #0a5b64; text-align: center; }
    h2 { margin: 28px 0 10px; font-size: 15px; color: #71808a; font-weight: normal; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .04em; }
    table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; }
    th, td { padding: 10px 0; text-align: left; border-bottom: 1px solid #eef2f4; font-size: 15px; }
    th { color: #55707d; font-weight: normal; }
    td { text-align: right; font-weight: bold; color: #123c4a; }
    tr.total th, tr.total td { border-bottom: 2px solid #dfe7ea; font-size: 16px; }
    tr.total th { color: #123c4a; font-weight: bold; }
    .owes { display: block; padding: 18px 20px; margin: 24px 0 8px; border-radius: 8px; background: #fdf1f2; color: #8a1f2b; font-size: 24px; font-weight: bold; text-align: center; }
    .owed { display: block; padding: 18px 20px; margin: 24px 0 8px; border-radius: 8px; background: #eef8f2; color: #137a4b; font-size: 24px; font-weight: bold; text-align: center; }
    .clear { display: block; padding: 18px 20px; margin: 24px 0 8px; border-radius: 8px; background: #f2f5f6; color: #55707d; font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold; text-align: center; }
    .note { margin: 0 0 20px; color: #71808a; font-size: 14px; text-align: center; }
    .button { display: inline-block; margin: 8px 0 20px; padding: 13px 24px; border-radius: 6px; background: #087f8c; color: #fff !important; text-decoration: none; font-weight: bold; }
    .footer { padding: 22px 36px; background: #f7fafb; color: #71808a; font-size: 13px; }
    @media screen and (max-width: 480px) { .content, .header, .footer { padding: 26px 22px; } h1 { font-size: 22px; } }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="wrapper">
    <div class="card">
      <header class="header">
        <p class="brand">MessMate</p>
      </header>
      <main class="content">
        <h1><%= monthName %> <%= year %></h1>
        <p class="lead">Hi <%= userName || 'there' %>, <strong><%= messName %></strong> has closed the month. Here is your share.</p>

        <p class="rate">
          The mess spent <strong>BDT <%= totalGrocery %></strong> on groceries over
          <strong><%= totalMeals %></strong> meals.<br>
          That makes this month's meal rate <strong>BDT <%= mealRate %></strong> per meal.
        </p>

        <h2>What you owe</h2>
        <table>
          <% if (hasOpeningBalance) { %>
            <tr><th><%= openingWasOwed ? 'Brought forward from last month' : 'In credit from last month' %></th><td>BDT <%= openingWasOwed ? '' : '- ' %><%= openingBalance %></td></tr>
          <% } %>
          <tr><th>Your meals</th><td><%= mealCount %></td></tr>
          <tr><th>Meal cost (<%= mealCount %> &times; <%= mealRate %>)</th><td>BDT <%= mealCost %></td></tr>
          <% sharedLines.forEach(function (line) { %>
            <tr><th><%= line.label %></th><td>BDT <%= line.amount %></td></tr>
          <% }); %>
          <% if (sharedLines.length === 0) { %>
            <tr><th>Utilities and other shared bills</th><td>BDT <%= sharedCost %></td></tr>
          <% } %>
          <tr><th>Rent share</th><td>BDT <%= rentShare %></td></tr>
          <% if (hasAdvance) { %>
            <tr><th>Next month's deposit</th><td>BDT <%= advanceCharged %></td></tr>
          <% } %>
          <tr class="total"><th>Total payable</th><td>BDT <%= totalPayable %></td></tr>
        </table>

        <h2>What you already put in</h2>
        <table>
          <% if (hasDeposit) { %>
            <tr><th>Deposit</th><td>BDT <%= depositTotal %></td></tr>
          <% } %>
          <% if (hasPaidExpense) { %>
            <tr><th>Bazaar you paid for yourself</th><td>BDT <%= paidExpenseTotal %></td></tr>
          <% } %>
          <tr class="total"><th>Total credit</th><td>BDT <%= creditAmount %></td></tr>
        </table>

        <% if (owes) { %>
          <strong class="owes">You owe BDT <%= dueAmount %></strong>
          <p class="note">Pay it with bKash from your bills page, or hand it to the manager.</p>
          <% if (loginUrl) { %>
            <p style="text-align:center"><a class="button" href="<%= loginUrl %>">Pay my bill</a></p>
          <% } %>
        <% } else if (isOwed) { %>
          <strong class="owed">The mess owes you BDT <%= refundAmount %></strong>
          <p class="note">You paid for more groceries than you ate this month. Collect it from the manager.</p>
        <% } else { %>
          <strong class="clear">You are all square &mdash; nothing owed either way.</strong>
        <% } %>

        <p>If any of this looks wrong, tell your manager before the month is settled. The register and every expense are readable by the whole mess.</p>
        <p>Warm regards,<br><strong>The MessMate Team</strong></p>
      </main>
      <footer class="footer">
        <p>This is an automated message. Please do not reply to this email.</p>
        <p>&copy; <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> MessMate. All rights reserved.</p>
      </footer>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
